# LF in the object database AND in the working tree, on every platform.
#
# Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites text files to
# CRLF on checkout. knomit's tests read these templates byte for byte (for
# example the fenced blocks in the mission skills and the `id:` line in each
# ontology), so a CRLF checkout fails them on a default Windows install. eol=lf
# takes the choice away from each machine's git config.
* text=auto eol=lf
